      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/85f322/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-06-05T14:01:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;evandan55&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"evandan55\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>That’s true. I should have checked that. Oh well. I’m gonna stick with my theory. Truth be damned.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, technically she’s just choosing to run so fast that the human body just can’t stand up to the stress of it.  She’s only got super speed and a brain awesome enough to calculate how fast she can go without damaging herself, not super endurance or whatever.</p>\n<p>However, one of our mottoes around here is “Never let the truth get in the way of a good story” so I say stick to your guns! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
